e many ways to progress through Outhold, the choice is up to you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767740/extras/d63ca07d1c9868b57b63b94be51d7cb8.poster.avif?t=1751442425\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767740/extras/d63ca07d1c9868b57b63b94be51d7cb8.webm?t=1751442425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767740/extras/d63ca07d1c9868b57b63b94be51d7cb8.mp4?t=1751442425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
